# Third-party reference corpora (GolfDB and anything like it). Kept out of git for licensing
# as much as size: the upstream annotations and per-clip rows keyed to named tour players are
# third-party data we redistribute nothing of. Only *aggregate* statistics are committed, and
# those live in the package at src/golf_coach/analysis/benchmarks/. See ADR-012.
data/reference/

